[{"title":"敬和堂尊洪先生西征二首 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"将星垂曜烛西南，江汉师行惯解骖。\n鸟道层空千里阁，旌头划破半江岚。\n雪深淮蔡须成算，夜宴宾僚未易参。\n露布驰功报天子，脱衣沽酒壮歌酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敬和堂尊洪先生西征二首 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"老健真逾马据鞍，封侯不道丈夫难。\n阵图石上书千卷，钗钏途中菜几盘。\n壮略春分江雨断，雅歌夜逼蜀山寒。\n安排凯乐迎归节，虎拜蜩蝉换豸冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"低枝花蘸水流香，未信游人苦日长。\n见说西湖好风景，山川别是一温凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"倚墙梅绽雨中肥，落弹惊回燕雀飞。\n见说西湖好风景，不知处士几时归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其三","author":"夏良胜","text":"管弦声拂柳堤通，双颊微微带酒红。\n见说西湖好风景，昔年曾认画图中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其四","author":"夏良胜","text":"镜痕风静露纹平，万点寒山落影清。\n见说西湖好风景，杖藜何日傍湖行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其五","author":"夏良胜","text":"混元罨画野屏舒，一老烟蓑钓上鱼。\n见说西湖好风景，尽拈书卖肯移居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其六","author":"夏良胜","text":"采莲曲里采莲船，碧落中浮去更还。\n见说西湖好风景，柂楼蚤饭惜花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其七","author":"夏良胜","text":"六桥人卖浊醪香，斜带疏篱花半黄。\n见说西湖好风景，不如秋叶过江忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其八","author":"夏良胜","text":"寒潭风雨洗娟娟，人上水晶宫里船。\n见说西湖好风景，越中真有小壶天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和忆西湖十绝 其九","author":"夏良胜","text":"雪峰眼底无巴蜀，寒月纷纷雁荡来。\n见说西湖好风景，山阴旧伴许流杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和平麓秋夜作","author":"夏良胜","text":"深夜坐庭华月满，新秋爽气净炎蒸。\n题诗剔蠹嫌无酒，作字如蝇不用灯。\n湿露添凉恬睡鹤，西风摇劲起饥鹰。\n只愁井上梧桐叶，渐渐离披数未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"忽去忽来如寤寐，相违相见已忘言。\n望尘独倚长亭下，勒马难回落木边。\n家信劳兄三载梦，官箴费我五更眠。\n浮云好似憎怀抱，明日楚江今日燕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"忆弟郢船棹更疾，送兄冀马行偏迟。\n异乡同气重留恋，一日万里分路岐。\n刀圭吐纳还自爱，平生温饱恒观颐。\n粗布大被及蚤制，频频为卜归来期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其三","author":"夏良胜","text":"孤鸿高骞志在远，双凤食竹不长群。\n裹药却病思见弟，牵衣割爱苦事君。\n抱琴便作思归引，储钱为买抛青春。\n闻道乡郊尚多垒，厚集战士方如云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其四","author":"夏良胜","text":"来时葛衣畏杲日，别去尽脱轻罗裳。\n喜根天性翻作怨，愁向人前却类狂。\n加餐谩说长为客，饮水方知不似乡。\n故园花鸟如相候，时有青州来短墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其五","author":"夏良胜","text":"行路莫计几多日，不到家时行未休。\n孤侄拍手迎门笑，老母望眼依闾愁。\n开土近山宜树栗，引泉入沼容方舟。\n结交旧有陶与谢，相招时作东湖游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其六","author":"夏良胜","text":"还家短日思永日，行路无情元有情。\n天涯手足向分袂，故国山水寒齐盟。\n不妨深雪压篷屋，秪愁缺月临孤城。\n谷口子真韩吏部，逢人惟说泪交横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其七","author":"夏良胜","text":"借楼曾当望云亭，三岁寒宵梦杳冥。\n苏子连床成偶合，狄公踪迹厌丹青。\n相逢欲话还无语，忍别沈酣尚怕醒。\n疋马郊关轻万里，为贪西谷煮寒冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其八","author":"夏良胜","text":"十年不作江湖游，今日重来缓我忧。\n女柩才归土未掩，妻骸束縳岁已周。\n官常苦系甘贫病，家祸因仍谁怨尤。\n江南不独赋庾信，摇落更多悲早秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其九","author":"夏良胜","text":"懒心避俗通三昧，恩义驱人说二难。\n捩柁风生催郢客，出门云杳入燕山。\n纵横士马悲途梗，惯熟楼台当旅还。\n举目烟霄有征雁，几时书帛寄乡关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其十","author":"夏良胜","text":"寒郊佳处总堪悲，仗剑南行远我师。\n入路便知归有日，到家翻忆别多时。\n百忧欲洒千行泪，两地难禁半夜思。\n宦学恶怀谁共赋，满床纤管不成词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其十一","author":"夏良胜","text":"冷风吹落归湖雁，霜月照寒啼树乌。\n山县且听更鼓响，江乡须避夜灯疏。\n肃清门户远城郭，整理冠裳拜帝都。\n愧我尚为升斗累，洛中思见马君无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜别家兄十二咏 其十二","author":"夏良胜","text":"投檄云归便放舟，大兄真为掩吾羞。\n贾生应悔无长策，崔氏从前下冗流。\n恬退特书真宰奏，告身超格后人收。\n是非不必论今昔，深锁松筠禾黍秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵寄王青崖给舍","author":"夏良胜","text":"临椷洒墨便忘馨，为爱监军奋执冰。\n只恁干戈心上战，已拚老瘦见时惊。\n秦关野树闻鸡犬，巫峡安流惯雨晴。\n羌笛一声悬榻下，蚤从阊阖见文星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"园亭曲曲似山深，有约睢阳著谏林。\n莫道旧筌真忘却，爱君元是百年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"溟濛酥雨足花台，为报春工次第开。\n自是主翁深避俗，不须园吏候人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其三","author":"夏良胜","text":"坐石援琴一曲馀，隔墙鸣鹤乱池鱼。\n也知识到无声处，绿野堂中恐未如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其四","author":"夏良胜","text":"写却林塘更写山，墨池终日未曾乾。\n非关有意留踪迹，描画平生与后看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其五","author":"夏良胜","text":"才说宜休梦也清，杖藜今见几人行。\n昔年丁卯桥边事，别是乾坤一段情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其六","author":"夏良胜","text":"短草蒙茸花半菲，开门徙倚对春晖。\n野人不解主翁意，谷口年年恨未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其七","author":"夏良胜","text":"云隈矮屋压筼筜，风雨时时撼草堂。\n长老相寻谈故事，武侯坐石已非羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其八","author":"夏良胜","text":"烂菊垂枝傍竹叉，清芬绝胜弄春花。\n洗觥绕径酣吟赏，为惜西风老岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其九","author":"夏良胜","text":"嫩叶柔条押障青，顿教图画失真形。\n老松怪底生崖壑，不作人家倚屋屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十","author":"夏良胜","text":"凿破寒江活水侵，放船随处是山阴。\n仰天歌罢沧浪曲，落日归鸦已到林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十一","author":"夏良胜","text":"木节疏疏叶渐繁，果奴千树没人看。\n年来不管浮生计，睡足东窗日几竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十二","author":"夏良胜","text":"清风桥头思古人，囊无苏君金百斤。\n田庐仅仅足老我，鸢鱼上下逃形真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十三","author":"夏良胜","text":"棚花别主自成芳，似待诗狂与酒狂。\n未许悬车消息近，边陲烽火日来忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十四","author":"夏良胜","text":"超然台高秋半时，幽香自许幽人知。\n分付西风莫相怨，朝来已放出墙枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十五","author":"夏良胜","text":"不让西园景致多，洛中输我老摩挲。\n秪缘恩重怀忧蚤，为倩风篁作浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十六","author":"夏良胜","text":"位先八座裴公府，家近扁舟范蠡湖。\n见说午桥风骨好，寿时曾入画中无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十七","author":"夏良胜","text":"冰添渠水分馀润，风到松林却半回。\n进退有机饶自得，更于何处见胚胎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十八","author":"夏良胜","text":"招隐山头第四泉，坐来深汲见奫然。\n主人一挽天河力，引到方壶已十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其十九","author":"夏良胜","text":"南山真见北山移，莫怪名家擅两奇。\n好看畦蔬春雨足，许多滋味自家知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和待隐园二十咏 其二十","author":"夏良胜","text":"道源深处在人求，分得濂溪别院幽。\n花底酒杯池上钓，年来鱼鸟不相猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"几年移屋入山深，曾约烟霞老住林。\n悔却出来归已晚，山灵应笑负初心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"云满秋江月满台，江南风景梦中开。\n喜心倒极翻悲壮，一纸家书万里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其三","author":"夏良胜","text":"水火都消一念馀，盆池风浪足游鱼。\n眼前有物皆真境，坐到心斋亦自如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其四","author":"夏良胜","text":"不为南人便北山，白云飞尽泪痕乾。\n于今谁在中朝隐，才著冠裳已厌看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其五","author":"夏良胜","text":"雨回炎毒蚤秋清，瘦马驱驰怯泞行。\n独见晚山归路好，数声高鸟似关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其六","author":"夏良胜","text":"三十年过浪食菲，愧无佳句似元晖。\n名园何处追呼赏，不见山公倒载归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其七","author":"夏良胜","text":"春深谷口种筼筜，莫负坡仙咏雪堂。\n相对若为租税客，不须抵掌笑屠羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其八","author":"夏良胜","text":"世路纷纷又几叉，一场春梦一番花。\n经旬溽雨蒸炎毒，怪杀潢污落井华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其九","author":"夏良胜","text":"览镜翻疑两鬓青，几人尘世解逃形。\n东风不著闲花柳，谁写天真入翠屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十","author":"夏良胜","text":"新竹数茎明月侵，半窗光影半窗阴。\n巡檐欲共分良夜，不学相如赋上林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十一","author":"夏良胜","text":"灵椿倚屋绿云繁，潦倒停杯一笑看。\n昨夜秋涛新入枕，篷居堪作定风竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十二","author":"夏良胜","text":"遭逢此日还此时，一觞一咏谁相知。\n半筵凉月自宾主，不管鸣蝉高树枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十三","author":"夏良胜","text":"于今方信墨磨人，岛瘦郊寒郢匠斤。\n检点漫成才百首，知无一字逼唐真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十四","author":"夏良胜","text":"短壑长松老架芳，潜移谷狠与山狂。\n孤云杳杳飞来鹤，似为诗人索债忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十五","author":"夏良胜","text":"见说秋来铁骑多，寒分塞月影摩挲。\n多忧懒作征夫怨，老将知谁解雅歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十六","author":"夏良胜","text":"冰盘行菜不厌足，呼童煮茗撑江湖。\n放帘独坐亦自好，门外故人来有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十七","author":"夏良胜","text":"鲈鱼苦系张公子，一叶扁舟江上回。\n莫向园丁问生理，于今老鹤几番胎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十八","author":"夏良胜","text":"谋国吁筹开布泉，涓涓滴滴涴眉然。\n明农若为匡时策，自把犁锄望有年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其十九","author":"夏良胜","text":"榻连午院逐阴移，吟得诗成字字奇。\n客邸情怀归路景，几多心事几相知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅崇道写怀二十咏 其二十","author":"夏良胜","text":"青精饱饭更无求，丈席相期为探幽。\n愧我果为迂拙累，不知何以赞王猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和南墩长官写怀","author":"夏良胜","text":"独倚寒斋听漏传，宵残烛影月纷然。\n老亲药饵相扶久，二竖销磨报可全。\n有子愿输通籍蚤，事君须念食租前。\n四方志业还家梦，可是湖湘了百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"门将军词","author":"夏良胜","text":"重门深深候人立，夜深掩面愁人识。\n机心却笑痴门神，白昼弯弧不相射。\n今年守著屠沽儿，去岁浪说王谢宅。\n门衰门盛神不知，纸上功名殊费力。\n我家破屋无何有，美士入门不见丑。\n今年错把糊上门，邻里儿童尽惊走。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿公馆与舜俞年兄夜话","author":"夏良胜","text":"分宴江头春几度，巡檐笑语此宵中。\n万家烟火旧城郭，百里风光今异同。\n暝隔短墙索花品，月移当径问诗筒。\n明朝别有桥山赋，残角声悲接晓钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊刘谏议二首 其一","author":"夏良胜","text":"古木青回半夜飔，为添孤愤泣忠词。\n事君正始非时样，落第于今薄主司。\n汗竹已刊身后史，谏垣如见镜中丝。\n燕山秀异多灵物，窦氏诸郎几建祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊刘谏议二首 其二","author":"夏良胜","text":"肝肠坎坷日纡萦，落日严祠对古城。\n廷策有怀输蚤见，国忧何意幸终成。\n忠从寒士心逾壮，人到乡闾议更清。\n抱愧不能躬展拜，过门愁听夜乌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"当祀遇雨有感","author":"夏良胜","text":"山麓春云覆黄屋，雨丝脉脉送衰颜。\n忽来归鹤坐松滴，却换野猿啼莫殷。\n几处陵原开别殿，长留弓剑在人间。\n妙香隐隐祠官祝，萧索微臣掩袖还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]